      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOPPER TENACIOUS (5) found some support last start but struggled into eighth (30.60), beaten 13 lengths. Was in the money the start prior. Can atone. YEAH WOW (1) turned in a moderate run last time when sixth at this track over 340m behind Creeping Choice (19.91) in a Grade 5. Was in the money the start prior. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Key runner on best form. SOMETHING DARK (2) broke from a low draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only 1.3 lengths (19.19) behind Pure Momentum at this track. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Will give a great sight again. TERRY'S GIRL (7) was well fancied last time on the strength of a win two back but could only manage seventh (19.17) at Richmond. Some good form is emerging from her last run.",
